(text "0.7 V offset + 500 mV p-p -> about 0.45 to 0.95 V at 1X.\nNever run sensitivity illumination in NOISE mode.\nRelay contacts move at different times: discard all transitions." (at 238.76 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a638b8dc-1641-57b1-8b23-aa6d8bdcf541"))
